  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "We need a better way than what we have now!",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2006-01-26 11:17",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: eddie",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=372",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "With the exception of true unit level tests (that work at",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "the class level), hold off on integration tests until we get",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "some progress on Fedora-as-a-webapp (#585)",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Date: 2005-11-11 14:55",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sender: payette",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "Logged In: YES ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "user_id=128",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "We did a good job on the first pass for 2.1b.",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "1) develop a junit test to measure api method performance ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "using jmeter.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
